#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/enabling-chinese-japanese-korean-search.rst:12
msgid ""
"Starting on Mattermost v11.5, searching for Chinese, Japanese or Korean "
"(CJK) characters can be enabled with the `feature flag "
"<https://developers.mattermost.com/contribute/more-info/server/feature-"
"flags/#changing-feature-flag-values>`_ ``MM_FEATUREFLAGS_CJKSEARCH``."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST v11.5부터 중국어, 일본어, 한국어(CJK) 문자 검색을 `기능 플래그 "
"<https://developers.mattermost.com/contribute/more-info/server/feature-"
"flags/#changing-feature-flag-values>`_ ``MM_FEATUREFLAGS_CJKSEARCH``\\ 로 "
"활성화할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/enabling-chinese-japanese-korean-search.rst:14
msgid ""
"The general recommendation of `using either Elasticsearch or Opensearch "
"once the server reaches 2.5 million posts <https://docs.mattermost.com"
"/administration-guide/scale/enterprise-search.html#do-i-need-to-use-"
"elasticsearch-or-aws-opensearch>`_ still applies."
msgstr ""
"서버가 게시물 250만 개에 도달하면 `Elasticsearch 또는 Opensearch를 사용 "
"<https://docs.mattermost.com/administration-guide/scale/enterprise-"
"search.html#do-i-need-to-use-elasticsearch-or-aws-opensearch>`_\\ 하라는 "
"일반적인 권장 사항은 여전히 적용됩니다."

